    "insert": "The language in scientific work should be precise, formal, and objective to communicate ideas clearly and credibly, without trying the reader to convince. However, in this proposal there are some areas where the language could be further refined. For example avoid using “we”, “my” etc.. Instead, consider make it more neutral, objective. I recommend reviewing the text to eliminate subjective language. \n(Citations)"
  },
